135
00:06:58,730 --> 00:07:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... I'm hungry you see...</font>

136
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:05,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know... All Shinobi must...</font>

137
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:07,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't fight if I'm hungry!</font>

138
00:07:08,030 --> 00:07:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Up ahead will become full-blown
enemy territory.</font>

139
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:14,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't have time to
have relaxed meals so...</font>

140
00:07:16,330 --> 00:07:18,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, you guys eat too! Eat!</font>

141
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:26,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mm, this is good...</font>

142
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You prepared this especially for us?</font>

143
00:07:30,050 --> 00:07:36,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. It seems the prettiest girl
in the bar fell to my charm you see.</font>

144
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:42,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She made these with tender loving care.</font>

145
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go make some tea.</font>

146
00:07:46,610 --> 00:07:48,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... thanks...</font>

147
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:11,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tastes pretty good.</font>

148
00:08:14,470 --> 00:08:16,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tea is ready.</font>

149
00:08:19,390 --> 00:08:20,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go!</font>

150
00:08:21,980 --> 00:08:22,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go.</font>

151
00:08:22,890 --> 00:08:23,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks...</font>

152
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go.</font>

153
00:08:25,650 --> 00:08:27,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you Sasame...</font>

154
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:32,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame, you should come here
and eat with us too.</font>

155
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

156
00:08:59,310 --> 00:09:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage... What's wrong...?!</font>

157
00:09:02,850 --> 00:09:03,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!</font>

158
00:09:39,010 --> 00:09:41,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame did it...</font>

159
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it's come to this, they're ours.</font>

160
00:09:47,900 --> 00:09:49,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your wound still hasn't healed.</font>

161
00:09:49,810 --> 00:09:52,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kagero, you wait here.</font>

162
00:09:52,570 --> 00:09:56,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No mistake... They're Leaf Ninja.</font>

163
00:09:57,450 --> 00:10:00,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we take care of the Leaf pursuers...</font>

164
00:10:00,370 --> 00:10:04,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama will surely acknowledge
the power of the Fuma Clan.</font>

165
00:10:05,990 --> 00:10:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

166
00:10:07,710 --> 00:10:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's come back with good news.</font>

167
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:12,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And with the heads of
the Leaf Ninja as souvenirs!</font>

168
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:04,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally found it!</font>

169
00:11:14,650 --> 00:11:17,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At first I thought it was someone
from the Hidden Leaf Village.</font>

170
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's Sasame believe it or not...</font>

171
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:23,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kamikiri, Jigumo, Kagero...</font>

172
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is an odd reunion.</font>

173
00:11:28,750 --> 00:11:32,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Arashi?!
He wasn't with all you guys?!</font>

174
00:11:35,090 --> 00:11:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi is serving near Orochimaru-sama
and is spending his days training.</font>

175
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can I see Arashi?!</font>

176
00:11:45,050 --> 00:11:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're also going to work together
with us for Orochimaru-sama</font>

177
00:11:49,810 --> 00:11:51,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure you'll be able to see him.</font>

178
00:12:03,110 --> 00:12:04,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How'd it go?</font>

179
00:12:09,450 --> 00:12:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've done well.</font>

180
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this I'll be able to see Arashi, right?</font>

181
00:12:15,750 --> 00:12:18,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After we've finished them off!</font>

182
00:12:20,170 --> 00:12:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?! Weren't we just supposed to
take them to Orochimaru-sama</font>

183
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for examination after capturing them?!</font>

184
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We only need the heads
for the examination.</font>

185
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:31,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

186
00:12:32,270 --> 00:12:34,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These people... For my sake...!</font>

187
00:12:34,390 --> 00:12:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move it!</font>

188
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:39,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Wha...?!
— Huh?!</font>

189
00:12:44,110 --> 00:12:44,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

190
00:12:45,030 --> 00:12:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fuma numbing medicine
didn't work!</font>

191
00:12:47,490 --> 00:12:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We knew about it all along
from the beginning!</font>

192
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

193
00:12:59,500 --> 00:13:00,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substitution...?!</font>

194
00:13:01,260 --> 00:13:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I leave Sasame to you!</font>

195
00:13:02,510 --> 00:13:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave her to me!</font>

196
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:08,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame... Hang in there!</font>

197
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:17,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...? Why does Sasame have
to do something like this?!</font>

198
00:13:17,690 --> 00:13:20,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's not that she's doing it
against her will...!</font>

199
00:13:20,110 --> 00:13:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's something she wanted to do!</font>

200
00:13:22,610 --> 00:13:23,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Liar!</font>

201
00:13:24,610 --> 00:13:25,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true...</font>

202
00:13:27,070 --> 00:13:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...</font>

203
00:13:28,450 --> 00:13:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do to be able
to see Arashi again?</font>

204
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a difficult thing.</font>

205
00:13:33,330 --> 00:13:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just have to put the lights out of those
who infiltrated the Land of Rice Paddies.</font>

206
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:38,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to kill them...?!</font>

207
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll take them back to Orochimaru-sama
for examination.</font>

208
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:43,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So we're not going to kill, right?</font>

209
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:48,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we carry out that work
Orochimaru-sama will acknowledge us.</font>

210
00:13:50,470 --> 00:13:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hanzaki says that Arashi and everyone
are being tricked by Orochimaru.</font>

211
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:57,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He says that you'll just be used
and thrown away...</font>

212
00:13:57,480 --> 00:14:00,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hanzaki's just a traitor
who abandoned the village.</font>

213
00:14:01,230 --> 00:14:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will you believe what we say?</font>

214
00:14:03,820 --> 00:14:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or will you believe what a traitor says?</font>

215
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:11,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama will surely restore
our Fuma Clan...</font>

216
00:14:13,990 --> 00:14:18,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame, although you're still young
you're also one of the Fuma.</font>

217
00:14:19,670 --> 00:14:23,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Assist in the restoration
of our Fuma Clan...</font>

218
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:32,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you guys did trick Sasame!</font>

219
00:14:32,550 --> 00:14:35,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all for the restoration
of the Fuma Clan!</font>

220
00:14:39,310 --> 00:14:40,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little!</font>

221
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

222
00:14:48,650 --> 00:14:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

223
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...!</font>

224
00:14:50,610 --> 00:14:53,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-Zu-Ma-Ki...!</font>

225
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:59,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto Barrage!</font>

226
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:04,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad...!</font>

227
00:15:13,970 --> 00:15:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

228
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is for Sasame.
Prepare yourselves!</font>

229
00:15:29,030 --> 00:15:29,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

230
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:38,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... from before?!</font>

231
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:41,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Earth Style Jutsu user
in question, huh?</font>

232
00:15:41,790 --> 00:15:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, there's no point to using that
Art in this rocky area.</font>

233
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed the Ant Lion appears from
inside the ground</font>

234
00:15:53,010 --> 00:15:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the spreading of its wings under
the sunlight is</font>

235
00:15:55,350 --> 00:15:57,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but a momentary gleam.</font>

236
00:15:58,390 --> 00:16:01,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's when I die as Kagero!</font>

237
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:06,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful!</font>

238
00:16:13,910 --> 00:16:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this...?</font>

239
00:16:17,330 --> 00:16:18,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look! Naruto...</font>

240
00:16:25,830 --> 00:16:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

241
00:16:38,430 --> 00:16:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-Unbelievable!</font>

242
00:16:40,060 --> 00:16:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were a woman...?!</font>

243
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The clan will once again be
in a place lit by the sunlight...</font>

244
00:16:47,270 --> 00:16:50,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama promised that...</font>

245
00:16:51,230 --> 00:16:55,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll use this once-in-a-lifetime Art
if it's for the sake of that.</font>

246
00:17:00,830 --> 00:17:03,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kagero's Ninja Art: Ephemera!</font>

247
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Come with me!</font>

248
00:17:15,510 --> 00:17:16,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

249
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:37,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I feel like... I've seen this before...</font>

250
00:17:37,860 --> 00:17:40,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Toad Mouth Trap Jutsu.</font>

251
00:17:40,660 --> 00:17:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I summoned the extraordinarily
sturdy stomach of</font>

252
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:45,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Mount Myoboku's
Iwajuku Giant Toad.</font>

253
00:17:46,370 --> 00:17:47,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stomach...?</font>

254
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

255
00:17:51,550 --> 00:17:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's melting...</font>

256
00:17:53,590 --> 00:17:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I didn't do this</font>

257
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we wouldn't have been able to
defend ourselves from her Chakra.</font>

258
00:18:14,570 --> 00:18:19,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believed... that the clan
would someday...</font>

259
00:18:19,660 --> 00:18:21,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believed in that.</font>

260
00:18:31,350 --> 00:18:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sh-She vanished.</font>

261
00:18:34,250 --> 00:18:35,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got to hand it to her.</font>

262
00:18:36,290 --> 00:18:38,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She probably put all of her life
on the line</font>

263
00:18:38,550 --> 00:18:40,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attempted to save her comrades...</font>

264
00:18:42,750 --> 00:18:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unforgivable!</font>

265
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:49,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys...
the Fuma Ninja...</font>

266
00:18:50,190 --> 00:18:53,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Their feelings toward the clan
is the same as our feelings!</font>

267
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:59,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Manipulating the Fuma's desire
to restore their clan...</font>

268
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:05,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kick Orochimaru's ass no matter what!</font>

269
00:19:24,050 --> 00:19:25,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Where are we?</font>

270
00:19:27,060 --> 00:19:28,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kagero...!</font>

271
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:33,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You risked your life to save us?</font>

272
00:19:37,730 --> 00:19:39,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot...</font>

273
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:57,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please...</font>

274
00:19:58,670 --> 00:20:01,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please use your Medical Ninjutsu
to save her.</font>

275
00:20:02,050 --> 00:20:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our comrade doesn't have
long to live!</font>

276
00:20:06,970 --> 00:20:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Put your hands to your chests and think.</font>

277
00:20:12,190 --> 00:20:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Think about what you weren't
able to accomplish... okay?</font>

278
00:20:17,110 --> 00:20:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We risked our lives working for you...
to help you Orochimaru-sama.</font>

279
00:20:22,780 --> 00:20:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to restore the Fuma Clan!</font>

280
00:20:25,070 --> 00:20:27,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please recognize our work!</font>

281
00:20:28,990 --> 00:20:34,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll just have to atone for
your failure with your bodies.</font>

282
00:20:40,670 --> 00:20:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama!</font>

283
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry for the betrayal!</font>

284
00:21:12,190 --> 00:21:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

285
00:21:12,190 --> 00:21:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

286
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

287
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

288
00:21:23,360 --> 00:21:27,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

289
00:21:23,360 --> 00:21:27,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

290
00:21:27,770 --> 00:21:34,130
